{"event": "turn", "session_id": "156ea840fa1a4b9c976581b64dc428c0", "sequence": 1, "created_at": "2026-10-16T06:25:13.071458+00:00", "message": "请介绍KSA的待客饮茶习俗。", "resolved_question": "请介绍KSA的待客饮茶习俗。", "context_turns": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "disabled", "config_revision": 3, "compliance_blocked": false, "elapsed_seconds": 18.079, "model_calls": 2, "input_tokens": 6275, "output_tokens": 555, "response": {"answer": "关于KSA（沙特阿拉伯）的待客饮茶习俗，根据本次检索到的资料，可以介绍以下内容：\n\n**待客顺序**\n据 Saudipedia 记载，沙特待客礼仪中通常是先上咖啡、后上茶；如果场合包含午餐或晚餐，茶有时会在餐后较晚时段才端上。这是有记录的习俗，但并非每个家庭都遵循的统一规则。\n\n**风味添加**\n茶中可能加入薄荷、婆婆纳（speedwell）或其他芳香叶片。\n\n**一种特色做法**\nSaudipedia 还描述了“余烬茶”（ember tea）：在水壶中把水和糖放在余烬上煮沸，然后加入粗茶叶。这种风格与户外露营相关联。\n\n**来源**\n- Drinks in Saudi Arabia, Saudipedia（资料年份未标注）\n\n**需要说明的边界**\n- 以上是文献记录的习俗，不代表所有沙特家庭的普遍做法。\n- 本次检索到的其他资料分别涉及土耳其、阿塞拜疆和约旦的饮茶文化，与KSA无关，未纳入上述介绍。\n- 关于KSA待客饮茶的具体茶叶品种、器具规格、冲泡比例等更细的属性，本次证据未覆盖，无法验证，不作补充。", "intent": "question_answering", "intents": ["question_answering"], "confidence": null, "intent_source": "rules", "recommendations": [], "knowledge_sources": [{"title": "Drinks in Saudi Arabia, Saudipedia", "url": "https://saudipedia.com/en/drinks-in-saudi-arabia", "year": null}, {"title": "Culture of Çay (tea), UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage", "url": "https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/culture-of-cay-tea-a-symbol-of-identity-hospitality-and-social-interaction-01685?RL=01685", "year": null}, {"title": "Tea as a Symbol of Common Life and Culture in Anatolia, Go Türkiye", "url": "https://goturkiye.com/gastronomy/blog/tea-as-a-symbol-of-common-life-and-culture-in-anatolia", "year": null}, {"title": "Tea's place in Jordanian popular memory and culture, Petra News Agency", "url": "https://petra.gov.jo/index.php/ar/news/%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%8A%D9%88%D9%85-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B9%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D9%8A-%D9%84%D9%84%D8%B4%D8%A7%D9%8A-%D9%85%D8%B4%D8%B1%D9%88%D8%A8-%D9%8A%D8%AE%D8%AA%D8%B2%D9%84-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B0%D8%A7%D9%83%D8%B1%D8%A9-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B4%D8%B9%D8%A8%D9%8A%D8%A9-%D9%88